sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant AG as AutoGluon Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Predictor as AutoGluon Predictor<br/>(in-process)
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over AG,Storage: Flow 1: Model Loading at Startup
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        AG->>+Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: IAM/SA/Token
        Storage-->>-AG: Saved predictor files
        AG->>AG: detect_and_load_predictor()<br/>Try TimeSeriesPredictor.load()<br/>Fallback: TabularPredictor.load()
        Note over AG: version_compat.py validates<br/>major.minor match only<br/>(allows +rhaiv.N suffix)
        AG->>AG: Model ready on port 8080
    end

    Note over Client,Predictor: Flow 2: Tabular Inference (v2 Protocol)
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Client->>+KRBP: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.3<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        KRBP->>+AG: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>Auth: pre-authenticated
        AG->>AG: _infer_request_to_dataframe()<br/>Convert per-feature tensors → DataFrame
        AG->>+Predictor: TabularPredictor.predict()<br/>or predict_proba() if PREDICT_PROBA=true
        Predictor-->>-AG: Predictions / Probabilities
        AG->>AG: _build_v2_response()<br/>Map dtypes → v2 InferResponse
        AG-->>-KRBP: InferResponse (v2 tensor format)
        KRBP-->>-Client: HTTPS Response<br/>TLS 1.3
    end

    Note over Client,Predictor: Flow 3: Time Series Inference (v1 Protocol)
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Client->>+KRBP: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.3<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        KRBP->>+AG: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>Auth: pre-authenticated
        AG->>AG: Parse JSON body:<br/>history + known_covariates
        AG->>+Predictor: TimeSeriesPredictor.predict()<br/>with TimeSeriesDataFrame
        Predictor-->>-AG: Forecast DataFrame
        AG->>AG: Convert to JSON response<br/>with quantile columns
        AG-->>-KRBP: JSON prediction response
        KRBP-->>-Client: HTTPS Response<br/>TLS 1.3
    end
